        <div class="hkx-receipt">{{ t('Research context only — never a buy or sell signal. Generated nightly; the same brief appears on the China dashboard.','仅供研究参考 — 绝非买卖信号。每晚生成；同一份简报也出现在中国看板。') }}</div>
