             colour-coding + a tooltip citing its phase-0 report. A/H = the near-GO (DSR 0.879)
             → visual priority via fl-lead. SB flow decays at render lag (H1 NO-GO) → context. #}
          {% if n.southbound and n.southbound.accum_z is not none %}
          {% set sbz = n.southbound.accum_z %}
          <span class="{{ 'fl-buy' if sbz>=0.6 else ('fl-sell' if sbz<=-0.6 else '') }}" data-tip-en="Mainland Connect is adding or trimming this name. Positioning context." data-tip-zh="内地港股通正在加仓或减仓该股。持仓背景。">🇨🇳 {{ t('SB', '南向') }} {{ '%+.1f'|format(sbz) }}{% if n.southbound.own_pct is not none %} · {{ n.southbound.own_pct }}%{% endif %}</span>
